  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.1.0: Extends the Dafny-verified protocol core with receive admission, transmit and closing transitions, exact concatenation and length-header composition. Prevents interleaved list sends and unsafe reuse after partial sends, rejects invalid sequences before payload reads, and awaits peer Close during asynchronous disposal. Adds an audited .NET bulk-copy contract and a fully verified scalar reference. See docs/protocol-verification.md for proof scope and trusted boundaries.",
